              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OPEN \u2014 baseline, no control. Limit lines disappear, 429s stop. Natural traffic flows; client-green keeps hitting errors on mcp-flaky."
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "PROTECT-UPSTREAMS \u2014 AIMD limits appear. mcp-flaky's error ratio is above 5%, so its allowed tool-call rate halves in steps; healthy upstreams stay at the ceiling. Watch upstream_limit 429s squeeze mcp-flaky."
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "FAIR-CLIENTS \u2014 every client gets the same cap: 1.25x the average tool-call rate. Watch client-purple (the heaviest tool caller) get clipped with client_limit 429s while light clients are untouched."
                },
                "3": {
                  "text": "FULL-CONTROL \u2014 both loops + routing. New sessions avoid unhealthy mcp-flaky; reroutes fire and client-green's traffic shifts to mcp-stable (see MCP overview per-server panels), letting mcp-flaky recover."
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
